00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:02.180
demonstrates combining Figma's built-in AI agent with manual controls. This approach creates custom

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:08.300
visual filters and animations without starting from scratch. Users who work with Figma for design

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:14.120
or school projects can now experiment with motion graphics in a few clicks. The method lets

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:20.500
