agent-style helpers keep improving at real tasks. Recent measurements indicate agents now complete

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:55.280
about 16% of freelance jobs at professional quality. That figure marks an increase from 2.5% just

00:06:55.280 --> 00:07:01.380
8 months earlier. The gains result from clearer planning and self-checking steps rather than any

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:07.260
